# 统一换行：仓库内一律 LF，检出到 Windows 时 RTL/脚本用 LF，
# 避免同一份 Verilog 在两个人机器上 diff 出满屏整文件差异。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 明确文本类型
*.v      text
*.sv     text
*.vh     text
*.svh    text
*.cst    text
*.sdc    text
*.gprj    text
*.md     text
*.py     text
*.sh     text
*.tcl    text
*.yml    text
*.yaml   text
*.json   text

# 明确二进制类型：不要做换行转换，也不要尝试文本 diff
*.fs     binary
*.fsl    binary
*.bit    binary
*.bin    binary
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.jpeg   binary
*.pdf    binary
*.zip    binary
*.rar    binary
*.7z     binary
*.docx   binary
*.pptx   binary
*.xlsx   binary
*.xdc    text

# 波形与仿真产物不做 diff
*.vcd    binary
*.wlf    binary
*.wdb    binary
*.fst    binary

# GitHub 语言统计：避免把文档/例程算成主语言，误导仓库首页
*.md     linguist-documentation
docs/**  linguist-documentation
demo/**  linguist-documentation

# 第三方/生成代码不计入统计（若确有此目录，按需取消注释）
# third_party/**  linguist-vendored
# generated/**    linguist-generated
